    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It looks like github is somehow blocked from your machine - that is probably why install_github failed.<div><br></div><div>I believe that the reason that installing the master.zip file didn&#39;t work is because that is an unbuilt package, whereas RStudio expects to install a built package. To install an unbuilt package, you should first unzip the file, then use the `install` function from devtools:</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div> devtools::install(&#39;path/to/packagedir&#39;)</div><div><br></div><div>-Winston</div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Dec 30, 2013 at 10:25 AM, João Carlos <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jcani...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div>"
    ],
